Third-Party Acknowledgments

EmComm Control is an independent, open-source MeshMonitor script designed to integrate with:

- MeshMonitor (by Yeraze)
- Meshtastic (open-source LoRa mesh networking platform)
- MeshCore (open-source LoRa mesh networking platform)
- Amateur Radio emergency-communications operators and organizations
- Local radio clubs, served-agency teams, and mesh groups

The EXERCISE mode may be used for ARRL® Simulated Emergency Test (SET) activities and other drills. ARRL® and related names and marks are trademarks of the American Radio Relay League, Incorporated.

This project is not affiliated with, sponsored by, endorsed by, or officially connected to ARRL, MeshMonitor, Meshtastic, MeshCore, the FCC, or any referenced emergency-communications organization, service, or platform.

All trademarks, logos, and brand names are the property of their respective owners.
